    {
        "name": "bb-onstage-tab: not a late finding",
        "why": "_LATE_FINDING_IDS: a changed stamp re-runs the filter while a late finding filters. Covered here by another path: a cell-scope finding is ticked as a value in its column's filter input (_setFinding() → _writeUniqValueSet()), so _anyFilterActive() is true and the event-page columns' own refresh (_bbEvpScheduleRefresh()) re-runs the filter after every page read. Kept in the list for a row-scope fallback (two columns, Exclude mode), which no fixture reaches.",
        "edits": [
            {
                "find": "'sl-double-utf8', 'bb-onstage-tab', ..._BB_EVENT_CHECK_LATE_IDS];",
                "replace": "'sl-double-utf8', ..._BB_EVENT_CHECK_LATE_IDS];"
            }
        ],
        "spec": "tests/fixtures/bb-year-event-pages.spec.js",
        "grep": "ticked while pages arrive",
        "expect": "pass"
    },
